---
import Section from "@/components/ui/Section.astro";

const beganYear = 2018;
const experience = `${new Date().getFullYear() - beganYear} years`;
---

<Section id="about" title="about me">
	<div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		<p>
			my name is <span class="text-foreground">Nicolas</span>, and i currently work as a software engineer and game
			developer, mostly focused on Roblox, but always learning something new.
		</p>
		<p>i have <span class="text-foreground">{experience}</span> of experience in the field, since {beganYear}.</p>
		<p>
			currently studying Computer Science at
			<a
				class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
				href="https://www.cruzeirodosul.edu.br/"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
				>Cruzeiro do Sul University</a
			>, expected to graduate by the end of 2026.
		</p>
	</div>
</Section>
